"A4\",\n        \"text\": \"The environment here can help me relax my tense mood.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"A5\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel free from work and daily life here.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"B1\",\n        \"text\": \"I think the surrounding scenery is harmonious.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"B2\",\n        \"text\": \"I am quite curious about the invisible landscape.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"B3\",\n        \"text\": \"The landscape here can make me extend many beautiful associations.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"B4\",\n        \"text\": \"The elements of the landscape here are matched.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C1\",\n        \"text\": \"The environment here has attractive characteristics.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C2\",\n        \"text\": \"The environment here can attract me to explore and discover more.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C3\",\n        \"text\": \"The environment here is charming.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C4\",\n        \"text\": \"I will want to spend more time in this environment.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"D1\",\n        \"text\": \"I can do what I like here.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"D2\",\n        \"text\": \"I can adapt to the environment here quickly.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"D3\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel that I have integrated with this environment.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"D4\",\n        \"text\": \"I can find a way to enjoy myself here.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"D5\",\n        \"text\": \"This place is very suitable for doing what I like.\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \