  "description": "Faithful replication of Cao & Huang (2023), Research on the Healing Effect Evaluation of Campus' Small-Scale Courtyard Based on the Method of Semantic Differential and the Perceived Restorative Scale, Sustainability 15(10): 8369. Each participant is randomly given one of three small residential courtyards on a high-density university campus (I: large lawn with a badminton court; II: regular rows of shrubs and trees; III: irregular planting along a winding path), looks at a photograph of it and rates it on 17 seven-point semantic-differential word pairs and the 18-item Chinese Perceived Restorativeness Scale (1-7). Answers are keyed by courtyard.",
